"Camouflage masks are Wrightwork that increase the wearer's belonging within one environment."
"Each mask suits one setting: night and firelight, deciduous forest, meadow, or a single city."
"For wizards whose magic depends on a place or element, such a mask is a casting tool."
"The masks do not hide their wearer from the Contract."
"Mr. Dagim's Anesidora mask makes its wearer part of F-city: unseen, unheard, off camera."
"The Anesidora mask breaks Rabbit targeting both ways, and works only on Anesidora."
"Its wearer feels an icy chill, lessening the more at home they feel."
"It is rented for harmless mischief within a few blocks; businesses welcome pranks if repaid."
